WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.231
- [Off Camera] This is so sick!

00:00:01.231 --> 00:00:02.106
- Woo!

00:00:02.106 --> 00:00:04.689
(techno music)

00:00:14.196 --> 00:00:15.029
♪ Go ♪

00:00:15.029 --> 00:00:17.196
(screams)

00:00:21.942 --> 00:00:23.708
(slow piano music)

00:00:23.708 --> 00:00:26.098
- It's really (beep)-ing high up here.

00:00:26.098 --> 00:00:28.805
Nobody said that it
was gonna be this high.

00:00:28.805 --> 00:00:31.385
(upbeat music)

00:00:31.385 --> 00:00:32.218
- So we are here right now

00:00:32.218 --> 00:00:33.251
at Slotzilla.
(Daysha groans)

00:00:33.251 --> 00:00:37.211
We're about to go off the
top, and Daysha's so excited.

00:00:37.211 --> 00:00:39.940
- Yeah, there's a lot of
excitement on my face right now.

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:41.741
- Have you ever ziplined before?

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:43.571
- No, I've never ziplined.

00:00:43.571 --> 00:00:45.223
I'm slightly nervous, but I also

00:00:45.223 --> 00:00:47.131
don't wanna let my fears hold me back.

00:00:47.131 --> 00:00:49.586
I'm just here and I'm gonna
do it and I might black out

00:00:49.586 --> 00:00:50.974
but that's okay. (laughs)

00:00:50.974 --> 00:00:52.744
- I had no idea that it looks like this,

00:00:52.744 --> 00:00:54.344
but like, literally you're lying down

00:00:54.344 --> 00:00:56.969
and then they, like,
open the gates of wrath

00:00:56.969 --> 00:00:58.170
and then you go.

00:00:58.170 --> 00:00:59.923
That's a little bit terrifying to me.

00:00:59.923 --> 00:01:00.756
You ready for this?

00:01:00.756 --> 00:01:02.182
- Yeah, let's do it.

00:01:02.182 --> 00:01:03.495
- Wait, we have to do it again.

00:01:03.495 --> 00:01:04.426
Okay, boom.

00:01:04.426 --> 00:01:07.737
♪ "Eine kleine Nachtmusik"
by Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart ♪

00:01:07.737 --> 00:01:10.272
- I'm gonna be cussing the whole time.

00:01:10.272 --> 00:01:11.535
(pop)

00:01:11.535 --> 00:01:13.798
- When I was little
and I swam in the pool,

00:01:13.798 --> 00:01:15.012
I would go to the very surface

00:01:15.012 --> 00:01:17.144
and pretend like I was flying,

00:01:17.144 --> 00:01:19.011
and I feel like that's what
this is gonna be like now

00:01:19.011 --> 00:01:20.089
but in real life,

00:01:20.089 --> 00:01:22.940
and it's gonna be all my
childhood dreams come true.

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:24.149
(Daysha playfully cries)

00:01:24.149 --> 00:01:26.088
- We just lay down? Oh
my God, it's moving!

00:01:26.088 --> 00:01:27.921
(pop)

00:01:31.439 --> 00:01:33.272
(pop)

00:01:35.856 --> 00:01:38.436
(Daysha laughs, Lizz groans)

00:01:38.436 --> 00:01:39.664
- How is this my job?

00:01:39.664 --> 00:01:40.840
(groans)

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:45.093
- Okay, I'm just gonna act
real tough, like I got this.

00:01:45.093 --> 00:01:48.510
(screaming and laughing)

00:01:50.401 --> 00:01:53.773
(techno music)

00:01:53.773 --> 00:01:57.273
- [Off Camera] Oh my God, this is so sick!

00:01:58.569 --> 00:02:02.745
(screaming and cheering)

00:02:02.745 --> 00:02:04.828
- [Off Camera] Oh my God.

00:02:06.692 --> 00:02:09.072
- [Lizz] I don't even,
I can't feel my face.

00:02:09.072 --> 00:02:10.369
- That was so cool!

00:02:10.369 --> 00:02:12.134
- It was like the closest I've ever felt

00:02:12.134 --> 00:02:14.777
to flying like Superman.

00:02:14.777 --> 00:02:16.908
It was like when I was a kid, in the pool.

00:02:16.908 --> 00:02:18.998
Like, that's what it
felt like, but real life.

00:02:18.998 --> 00:02:22.410
- I hate that I was so scared,
'cause it's so much fun.

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:23.534
- That part at the end is the worst.

00:02:23.534 --> 00:02:24.561
- [Daysha] Yeah, that, honestly.

00:02:24.561 --> 00:02:26.148
- [Lizz] When they just like, pshh.

00:02:26.148 --> 00:02:27.023
Oh my God!

00:02:27.023 --> 00:02:29.661
- I feel like I'm about
to drop every single time.

00:02:29.661 --> 00:02:32.167
But I'm so glad I didn't let
my fears get the best of me.

00:02:32.167 --> 00:02:34.205
I could do this all day, honestly.

00:02:34.205 --> 00:02:36.149
And I'm someone that has a fear of depth

00:02:36.149 --> 00:02:37.722
or height or whatever you wanna call it.

00:02:37.722 --> 00:02:39.835
Like, looking down from very high points

00:02:39.835 --> 00:02:42.467
scares the shit outta me, and I love this.

00:02:42.467 --> 00:02:45.100
Like, I have to now
zipline throughout my life.

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.607
- Can we zipline to the car?

00:02:46.607 --> 00:02:47.440
- Yeah!

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:48.808
Woosh!

00:02:48.808 --> 00:02:50.020
- [Lizz] Woo!

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:50.853
- [Daysha] I'm ready to go again.

00:02:50.853 --> 00:02:52.469
- [Lizz] Let's do it.

00:02:52.469 --> 00:02:55.052
(techno music)

